{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_title", "source_sha256": "f565e887ab90e7fbdccfd6099309e8c6229892bbc72d326b2846ec7774ba5cfc", "ja": "新生『I.V.』誕生", "zh": "新生『I.V.』诞生", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_synopsis", "source_sha256": "34f2c7e93246f95bd75d861a29db7afedf1bdf4d8fd46f07447043c53924df78", "ja": "オーディション最終選考まで残ったなると\n真珠星は、お互い全力でぶつかり合うことを\n約束。最終的に新生『I.V.』は藍・真珠星と\nクロエ・なるのデュオ、計4人での\nデュオユニットで始動すると発表される。", "zh": "一路通过试镜最终评审的なる与真珠星约定要全力较量。最终宣布，新生『I.V.』将以藍・真珠星和クロエ・なる组成的双人组合、共计4人正式启动。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1000_null", "source_sha256": "f29b7257410c3de9b03e432f840e8310615acb954f1e13c0ff733da549a1e1be", "ja": "新生『I.V.』選考オーディション、途中経過……", "zh": "新生《I.V.》选拔试镜，中途结果……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1001_038chz", "source_sha256": "c10a42319bbde094ce534188f80f7fcb2f806400d224f8089bd0a9896681d17d", "ja": "合格者は3番、12番、20番。\n以上よ。", "zh": "合格者为3号、12号、20号。\n以上。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1002_traineea", "source_sha256": "2d2093e3a10496a1130ab4011ac85c95eae0720791b15e8ed933344d0c8991d7", "ja": "う……。", "zh": "呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1003_traineeb", "source_sha256": "586ffc77e4c21f4e76a8fee042a3bd3890b5fdff59ccc66e2b882f57bafed2c8", "ja": "わ、私……落ちたんだ……\nうう……ぐすっ……！　うう……。", "zh": "我、我……落选了……\n呜呜……抽泣……！呜呜……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1004_045kar", "source_sha256": "8086c068b7b4ef7a246997c11403a7d91e3768e37e41ec0936d81a4adbbc765e", "ja": "いつまでもそんなところにいられると、次の人の邪魔。\n泣くなら廊下で、思う存分どうぞ。", "zh": "你要是一直待在那里，会妨碍下一个人的。要哭的话，就去走廊上尽情哭吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1005_047sub", "source_sha256": "0d278adcfb0b58e477834500c4ffe35f6778e5d4ad1356450dea43f22a5f35b8", "ja": "ちょっと！　そんな言い方しなくても……。", "zh": "等一下！不用说得这么过分吧……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1006_045kar", "source_sha256": "94f96d53170c5814e162c2a0ffb7fae76c364a40ea613890d7cb16445bf0c8d5", "ja": "あなた、落ちたら慰めてほしいと思う？\n優しい言葉を掛けられたい？　落ちたのに？", "zh": "你要是落选了，会想让我安慰你吗？\n想听我说些温柔的话？明明都落选了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1007_047sub", "source_sha256": "33cf5d28ede4f19e020c5003d86adfee53958e4f19e00165054f710c413f2764", "ja": "ぐ……だ、だからって！", "zh": "呜……可、可也不能因为这样啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1008_027say", "source_sha256": "4a93183a68394545389e1f8689621433e8a3edb9f99824f2d2edf2f33f26520b", "ja": "血の気が多いのは結構だけど、今は選考中よ。\n受ける気がないなら、ふたりとも出て行きなさい？", "zh": "有冲劲是好事，不过现在还在选拔中。要是不打算参加，你们两个就出去吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1011_null", "source_sha256": "d732e80c1f0738f1fb9ddfe73cadc671533f53150dce30f4a88a635c9aa94343", "ja": "最終選考前……", "zh": "最终选考前……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1012_028ari", "source_sha256": "49704c95434a853c76da5e468e774c4c3b3215436391138c388fec0977816b6e", "ja": "真珠星ちゃん！\n……お互い、残れたね。", "zh": "真珠星！\n……我们都晋级了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1013_047sub", "source_sha256": "7170842b0de953ebf78a0e157acdacf990b13a72a19fd44edf8b718c299e30bd", "ja": "なるちゃん！　うん、よかった。\n最終選考、なにするのかな……。", "zh": "奈留！嗯，太好了。\n最终选拔要做什么呢……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1014_028ari", "source_sha256": "7d0decf96bdcc50f798b689f69800173fe0af28e1a110b89f7214fb8aa0a5aa4", "ja": "……あのね。私、真珠星ちゃんのすごさ、\nこの中で誰よりも知ってると思うんだ。", "zh": "……那个啊。我觉得真珠星有多厉害，\n这群人里没有人比我更清楚了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1015_028ari", "source_sha256": "d2785e1365079e315f69aab4422e67e3152ace1ef9c07a058e0674c2cbc77c79", "ja": "苦手だったダンスを頑張って、\nバックダンサーの特訓をやり切ったこと。", "zh": "她不擅长跳舞，却拼命努力，把替舞演员的特训坚持到了最后。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1016_028ari", "source_sha256": "eb5494a88266ac9f8a918f790cc8fd5b4721f49b3b7d06120ad6e07214b522eb", "ja": "途中から入ってきたのに、\n私よりも、ぐんぐん伸びてること……。", "zh": "明明是中途才加入的，却比我进步得还快……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1018_028ari", "source_sha256": "7f7ebf4b591bc71653c79108667b4e2010a81ed419a64a2e2b3807c6961730ff", "ja": "あのね、だから……お願い。\n手加減しないで。", "zh": "那个，所以……拜托了。\n请不要手下留情。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1019_047sub", "source_sha256": "438f5d5825a6ad3d244b99778d03e0610e98143414720c33ab174686ce1b6f36", "ja": "なるちゃん……。", "zh": "鸣……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1020_028ari", "source_sha256": "6457ca69310b698e415e5eb03bad8788a42eb7041bd1a83d72655d9e456d92ae", "ja": "私は、本気でアイドルになりたい。\n……だから。", "zh": "我是真心想成为偶像的。\n……所以。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1021_047sub", "source_sha256": "9a49cb67a74de4f07ba3e34c9953785c3c485e2e6d5c4fdcd78c22a65210df44", "ja": "うん……もちろん！\n私も、全力でぶつかるよ！", "zh": "嗯……那是当然！\n我也会全力以赴的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1022_038chz", "source_sha256": "521c5b83ceb6d679950a8d4b1a59e83cf756abeaffa40245216b7eaba18217dd", "ja": "真珠星、なる、クロエ……\n最終選考のパフォーマンスを見た上で、どう？", "zh": "珍珠星、鸣、克洛伊……\n看过最终选拔的表演后，感觉怎么样？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1023_027say", "source_sha256": "0e31422ca912fc99975464abf438503c8886e88e485dd6a71a5052ac43744b24", "ja": "……そうね。", "zh": "……也是呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1024_027say", "source_sha256": "5a7b7edc961a6de407f7b279fe09207d1d85963928071925a7f13eb98fc3b8b8", "ja": "やっぱり、例のアイディアでいくべきだと思う。\n多分、それが一番いいはず。", "zh": "果然，我觉得还是应该采用之前说的那个点子。\n我想那样应该就是最好的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1025_038chz", "source_sha256": "ffe1a268f969c803f205d7ddb04865c90ea367106decbca68520b4b0df96bfc5", "ja": "……ありがとう。\nということです、社長。", "zh": "……谢谢你。\n社长，情况就是这样。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1026_038chz", "source_sha256": "0268f935f2a469498d2771a93f3d5ebaf2a5f4ff48c3686ff97db0d323f527ff", "ja": "新生『I.V.』、この形をFIXとして\n進めたいと思います。よろしいですか？", "zh": "全新的《I.V.》就按这个形式定稿推进，可以吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1027_null", "source_sha256": "efc1d82f27c00c2cd66242ba3968b75b5084f0ad635f478df59f2ea4ca40369e", "ja": "そして……", "zh": "然后……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1028_047sub", "source_sha256": "d24b6e1736a60e5116855ae10cad9f88ee6def1263483340c463cf9e3d4c4ec0", "ja": "やることはやりきったつもりだけど……\n結果発表、いつまで待たせるんだろ。", "zh": "该做的事我自认都尽全力做好了，但是……\n公布结果到底还要让人等多久啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1029_028ari", "source_sha256": "b22b8321f2f8054f4ef0ae4289900b81cafedde2bdcf604313c3c3fc1713893a", "ja": "うん……。", "zh": "嗯……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1031_null", "source_sha256": "db1ed45a1bc0472ed71bc5d1969f1d6660d1bdfe8929f5c6d936faf21babc89a", "ja": "ガチャ", "zh": "（开门声）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1032_038chz", "source_sha256": "4f56273345731feaa431406407d4d37d4bdea2428f388ee92fe40986776e1328", "ja": "お待たせ。\nまずは、オーディションの結果を発表するわ。", "zh": "让你久等了。\n首先，我来宣布试镜的结果。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1033_038chz", "source_sha256": "77db1d38baaa6702e1408549f51358d91cb4eb381d48411aa06fcb3fdec44501", "ja": "新生『I.V.』は2チーム制を採用する。\nデュオを2組、計4人のユニットよ。", "zh": "新生『I.V.』采用2队制。\n由2组双人组合组成，共计4人的组合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1034_028ari", "source_sha256": "1ed57afa4dc1df868949ee821b467d629efa6c1d7b542cf92493682525a0d793", "ja": "え……2チーム制？", "zh": "诶……2组队制？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1035_045kar", "source_sha256": "607172d0c52e7400d69a5b58b7074525c6a946423a8aa0cfc150dc1d4e66c459", "ja": "……どういうこと？", "zh": "……什么意思？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1036_027say", "source_sha256": "547befb600047c5075c8f4494d4dbe8019db31f2d9861527368d67499383b7ae", "ja": "どうもこうも、聞いた通りよ。まず\n『Indigo Blue』は私、真珠星のデュオ。", "zh": "没什么特别的，就是你听到的那样。首先，『Indigo Blue』是我和真珠星组成的双人组合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1037_027say", "source_sha256": "3735e2d7ca9286cba296f95d51c87d0cdcee7477019c42f4d93486d215ddb139", "ja": "そして『Vermilion Red』は\nクロエ、なるのデュオ。", "zh": "而『Vermilion Red』则是克洛伊和成的双人组合。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1038_027say", "source_sha256": "f7840a7896345d35007e2bc8d5d5f89fd3a57b772ab3125318084ddbb67f8214", "ja": "ふたつのデュオユニットを合わせたものを\n新生『I.V.』として始動させる……ってこと。", "zh": "也就是说，要把两个双人组合合并起来，作为新生的《I.V.》开始活动……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1039_047sub", "source_sha256": "489042dc42e514b28709c7e148fe78481772c71b2c29830d898731a9c57d95f7", "ja": "はっ、はあ！？\n『I.V.』はデュオユニットのはずじゃ……！", "zh": "哈、哈啊！？\n『I.V.』不是双人组合吗……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1040_027say", "source_sha256": "5cc9c0da6afc1039e6721e3e9d71e8788a4a8e539b885c35e9367518ae4c1268", "ja": "メンバーを増やしちゃいけない理由もないし、\n私もOKしたから。それに……。", "zh": "又没有不能增加成员的理由，而且我也同意了。再说……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1041_027say", "source_sha256": "f12f4ed8fda46575f613af1081320761efd86e1b4b0a7a127e2d63a065dfa1ad", "ja": "あなた達3人まとめたところで、\n織姫ひとりに釣り合うかどうか……ねえ？", "zh": "你们3个人加起来，能不能和一个织姬抗衡……很难说吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1042_047sub", "source_sha256": "95430e3f66e94c67ac348182ea07fad753d3072ba0db13142cff4fcf75c68723", "ja": "なんですって！？", "zh": "你说什么！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1043_027say", "source_sha256": "fa715b329adfe08f9ff93ce64771af5fd052ce596b34a36a7c02d66477ff0a23", "ja": "とにかく、そういうことで決まったから。", "zh": "总之，事情就这么定下来了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1044_038chz", "source_sha256": "5251e2958ac32f9169a0cb9736764b46d6503ebfcd0a58967a6b051024f0db55", "ja": "これからはこの4人が新生『I.V.』よ。", "zh": "从今以后，这4个人就是新生的『I.V.』了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1045_038chz", "source_sha256": "feea1225ef4526e92db518e1cbcac6eadd5879d733863a095532a8e8085bd225", "ja": "せいぜい頑張ってちょうだい。運用上の効率を\n考えて、良好な関係は維持するように。", "zh": "尽管努力吧。考虑到运营效率，请维持良好的关系。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1046_027say", "source_sha256": "05455559e7d6a09a74a0829865f99f058e52b32d335b103a29bb74ff2700be50", "ja": "本当にここまで来るとは思わなかったけど……。\nよろしくね、小さな相方さん？", "zh": "真没想到你真的能走到这里……以后请多关照啦，小个子搭档？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1047_047sub", "source_sha256": "4be7528e469c346a4afbff1f2302fdb4723f9e9eac7c2181455e6f15b5603134", "ja": "し、身長なんてすぐ伸びるし！\n絶対、追いついてやるんだから！", "zh": "身、身高什么的很快就会长高的！\n我绝对会追上你的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1048_045kar", "source_sha256": "99cbe71283068cd903ac32b1fd0483df9a6466b9519ffd23360caccec8da594c", "ja": "……。\n邪魔しないでくれたらいいから。", "zh": "……。\n只要别来碍事就好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0341_story_06_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0341_story_06_1049_028ari", "source_sha256": "f16b93577b4a79bf0bf95ed19ee2721c3016732c96ff66f4059a98eb2c7c84e6", "ja": "は、はいっ……！\n……うう、私、やっていけるかなぁ……。", "zh": "是、是……！\n……呜呜，我能坚持下去吗……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
